---
title: "How many wins do NRL teams need to make the finals?"
description: |
  It depends, but Monte Carlo simulations give us a pretty good idea
author: Mitch Henderson
date: 2025-01-27
thumbnailImage: /img/nrl_finals_probs.png
draft: false
format:
